# Generic executor layout

## Contract (shared)

`packages/session-brief` → `ExecutorPort` + `SessionBrief` + `ExecutorTranscript` only.

## Adapters (one folder each)

```
infrastructure/
  executor/create-executor.ts     # registry by executorId
  executor/not-implemented.ts     # shared throw helper
  dsh/          # implemented (host client + executors + map-history)
  pi/
  claude-code/
  aider/
  opencode/
  goose/
  codex/
  cursor-agent/
```

Inside each vendor folder, local helpers may be named `mapHistoryToTranscript` — **same generic name**, never `mapDsh*` / `mapPi*` in shared code. Path = vendor scope.

## Rules

- Kernel → `createExecutor(settings)` only.
- No vendor imports in kernel/web/shared.
- Placeholders **throw** — no FakeExecutor, no empty success.
- Implemented today: `dsh`. Placeholders: `pi`, `claude-code`, `aider`, `opencode`, `goose`, `codex`, `cursor-agent`.
